   <content>
      <section class="practice" id="sect-00001">
         <para id="para-00001">Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
            <exercise id="e1f655a9-5546-46d4-81b3-34e1ab3db3b0" class="multiple-choice">
               <problem id="prob-00001">
                  <para id="para-00002">For each equation in questions 1 – 5, identify the values of \(a\), \(b\), and \(c\) that you would substitute into the quadratic formula to solve the equation.</para>
                  <para id="para-00003">\(3x^2+8x+4=0\)</para>
                  <para id="para-00004">What is the value of \(a\)?</para>
                  <para id="para-00005">Enter the value of \(a\).</para>
               </problem>
               <solution id="sol-00001">
                  <para id="para-00006">Correct! \(a=3\)</para>
                  <para id="para-00007">Try again. Revisit activity 9.6.3.</para>
                  <para id="para-00008">The correct answer is \(a=3\).</para>
               </solution>
            </exercise>
